  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 50eb</p>\n<p>Have an AI give you fashion advice for all the latest trends, including tips on how to maximize the style of your existing wardrobe.</p>\n<p>Add +1 to your Waredrobe &amp; Style. This increases to +2 if you wear the clothes that RunWay suggests to you which often requires a purchase.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>An app runs on a Neuroport or an Agent and does nothing without one (see the House Rules journal). Keep it in the inventory while the character has either.</li>\n<li>The +1 to Wardrobe &amp; Style applies automatically; the extra +1 for wearing RunWay's suggestions is a toggle in the roll dialog.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Apps).</em></p>"
